    "title": "The Art of Event Catering: Elevating Cultural Galas - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By John Mali ,\n6 hours ago Cultural galas represent unique milestones for communities. These events combine history, fine attire, and shared values. Food plays a central role in these gatherings. Perfect execution requires a deep understanding of heritage. Culinary teams must balance age-old recipes with large-scale kitchen logistics. Every guest should feel a connection to the celebration through every bite. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
